  "notes": "Official 2025-2026 History (AA-T) Online (Traditional) transfer pathway to CSUB, Cal-GETC pattern. Per-semester printed totals 16 / 16-17 / 16 / 12; row sums reconcile exactly (16+16+16+12=60). Alternate pathway documents exist for the same degree (HIST-Trad-IWV, HIST-Public-IWV, HIST-Public-TEC); this Traditional Online variant is seeded as representative. Students planning the Social Science Subject Matter Certification waiver must also take World History surveys (HIST 1418 and HIST 1428) because Western Civ surveys are not approved by CCTC. Only semesters 1-4 (the Cerro Coso degree portion) are sequenced; semesters 5-8 are CSUB upper-division coursework and are excluded. Credit ranges use the source's lower bound (documented). No course-level prerequisites are printed on the pathway.",
